"This files that file as a media segment of the call and queues its\n"
"transcription, so a phone call and a Discuss call answer the same questions\n"
"through the same model: how long is the recording, what was said in it, and can\n"
"it be found by searching for a phrase.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing here knows a vendor, and nothing here indexes anything. The engine is\n"
"whichever one ``speech_ai`` selected, and the transcript is the attachment's\n"
"own index content.\n"
msgstr ""

