"базові модулі.\n"

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_customer
msgid ""
"\n"
"Publish your customers as business references on your website to attract new "
"potential prospects.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Публікуйте своїх клієнтів як бізнес референс на своєму веб-сайті, щоб "
"залучити нових потенційних клієнтів.\n"

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_approval_purchase
msgid ""
"\n"
"Purchase Order Approvals\n"
"========================\n"
"\n"
"Approval workflow on ``purchase.order`` through ``mixin.approval``.\n"
"\n"
"Approval triggers, configured per approval category:\n"
"\n"
"* amount inside ``order_amount_min`` / ``order_amount_max``\n"
"* vendors listed in ``order_partner_ids``\n"
"* product categories listed in ``product_categ_ids``\n"
"* vendor debit limit (``check_debit_limit``, ``debit_limit_threshold``)\n"
"* rate limit: more than ``po_rate_limit_count`` orders or\n"
"  ``po_rate_limit_amount`` within ``po_rate_limit_hours``\n"
"\n"
"``po_validation_level`` sets how strict validation is (none / above a manager\n"
"threshold / always). ``order_approval_mode`` only chooses which trigger fields\n"
"the category form shows — every non-empty criterion above constrains matching\n"
"regardless of it. Who approves, and in what order, is the category's steps.\n"
"``po_auto_confirm_on_approval`` confirms the order once approved.\n"
"Settings → Purchase carries the company-level rules.\n"
msgstr ""

