"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"This module also adds a security group.\n"
"\n"
"1. To activate it go to user and active \"Show Invoice Margin\" in\n"
"   security options.\n"
"\n"
"What installing it does to existing invoices\n"
"--------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
"Nothing. The margin columns are created empty and invoices raised before\n"
"installation carry no margin, because their cost at the time of sale is not\n"
"recorded anywhere the module can read.\n"
"\n"
"They are left empty on purpose. Seeding them from today's product cost would\n"
"put a number in every historical report that looks measured but is not, and\n"
"the earlier behaviour -- assuming a cost of zero, which reports a 100% margin\n"
"on everything -- was worse still.\n"
"\n"
"A line acquires its margin the first time it is recomputed. To backfill a\n"
"period deliberately, recompute the lines you care about, accepting that the\n"
"cost used is the product's cost now rather than its cost then.\n"
